  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Arcforge Players Compendium</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Tinker sphere (Security Measures), magical skill bonus +3.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> The following countermeasures can be granted to a gizmo. These countermeasures can only be disabled by creatures capable of disabling magical traps.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Glyph Trigger (requires Protection sphere (Glyph)):</strong> When you create a glyph, you may set it as a countermeasure on one of your gizmos or routines. Triggering the countermeasure causes the glyph to activate.</li>\n<li><strong>Immediate Recall (requires Warp sphere (Teleport Object)):</strong> The gizmo can teleport to a predetermined location or into the possession of a specific target within range.</li>\n<li><strong>Insurance Policy (requires Creation sphere):</strong> A specific amount of time after the gizmo destroys itself using self-destruct, you may have the gizmo reconstruct itself as if affected by your repair ability.</li>\n<li><strong>Telepathic Alarm (requires Tinker sphere ((transmission) package)):</strong> The gizmo can send a telepathic message to any number of designated targets within signal range.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/gizmo-feats#toc27\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
